], "A": [], "MP": [], "GM": {"PDCD1": ["28150777", "32963045"], "ICOS": ["32963045", "28150777"], "CXCL13": ["28150777", "32963045"]}, "GEN": 1}, "HUMAN_COMMON:0000034": {"L": "tissue-resident memory CD8 T cell", "T": "class", "P": ["HUMAN_COMMON:0000020"], "R": ["CD69", "CRTAM"], "S": ["CD3D", "CD8B", "CD3E", "CD8A", "GZMK"], "N": ["S1PR1", "KLF2", "SELL"], "D": null, "DF": ["ITGAE", "CXCR6", "ZNF683", "ITGA1"], "A": [], "MP": [], "GM": {"CD69": ["28930685", "28733665"], "CRTAM": ["28930685"], "ITGAE": ["28930685", "28214226"], "CXCR6": ["28930685", "28733665"], "ZNF683": ["33306940"], "ITGA1": ["28214226", "28930685"]}, "GEN": 1}, "HUMAN_COMMON:0000002": {"L": "B cell", "T": "class", "P": ["HUMAN_COMMON:0000070"], "R": ["MS4A1", "CD19", "CD79A"], "S": ["PTPRC", "BANK1", "CD74", "IGHD", "IGHM", "HLA-DRA"], "N": ["CD3E", "CD3D"], "D": null, "DF": ["CD79B", "PAX5", "MS4A1", "CD19", "CD79A"], "A": [], "MP": [], "GM": {"CD79A": ["36426942", "33208946", "35549406"], "CD19": ["23210908", "33208946", "35549406"], "MS4A1": ["29593838", "33208946", "35549406"], "PAX5": ["17440452"], "CD79B": ["36426942"]}, "GEN": 1}, "HUMAN_COMMON:0000131": {"L": "helper T cell", "T": "class", "P": ["HUMAN_COMMON:0000019"], "R": [], "S": ["CD4", "IL7R"], "N": ["CD8B", "CD8A"], "D": null, "DF": ["CD40LG"], "A": [], "MP": [], "GM": {"CD40LG": ["9597126"]}, "GEN": 1}, "HUMAN_COMMON:0000004": {"L": "macrophage", "T": "class", "P": ["HUMAN_COMMON:0000042"], "R": ["C1QA", "AIF1", "CSF1R", "C1QB"], "S": ["APOE", "LYZ"], "N": ["CD3E"], "D": null, "DF": ["MARCO", "C1QB", "CD163", "C1QC", "MSR1", "MRC1", "FOLR2", "C1QA", "CD68"], "A": [], "MP": [], "GM": {"MARCO": ["34626585"], "C1QB": ["29476078"], "CD163": ["32397365"], "C1QC": ["40593467"], "MSR1": ["36325338"], "MRC1": ["33490096", "32397365"], "FOLR2": ["40045365"], "C1QA": ["29476078"], "CD68": ["7680921"], "AIF1": ["40191733"], "CSF1R": ["40154882"]}, "GEN": 1}, "HUMAN_COMMON:0000108": {"L": "ductal cell", "T": "class", "P": ["HUMAN_COMMON:0000072"], "R": [], "S": ["KRT7", "KRT8"], "N": ["PRSS1"], "D": null, "DF": ["CFTR"], "A": [], "MP": [], "GM": {"CFTR": ["38262945"]}, "GEN": 1}}, "cp": [["adventitial fibroblast vs fibroblast (salivary gland)", [], "MFAP5 and CD34 (and PI16, currently unverified in this organ) mark the adventitial/universal subset; DCN, LUM, PDGFRA, COL1A1, COL3A1 are the parent fibroblast markers and CANNOT separate them (INV-1: the child holds delta markers only). PMID 37810210 splits human minor salivary gland fibroblasts into HSP90AB1+, SPON2+, MT-CYB+, MFAP5+ and IL32+ subsets - only the MFAP5+ one is this Term; an IL32+ / inflammatory fibroblast is NOT it."], ["endothelial cell of artery vs venous / capillary endothelial cell", [], "Arterial = GJA5 + SEMA3G (+HEY1, EFNB2, DLL4). Venous = ACKR1, PLVAP, NR2F2; capillary = CA4, RGCC (PMID 32971526 heart smFISH shows SEMA3G and ACKR1 in mutually exclusive vessels; PMID 33208946 lung smFISH the same for GJA5 vs ACKR1). In human salivary gland the ACKR1+ VENOUS subset is the abundant one and expands further in Sjogren's disease (PMID 37810210), so ACKR1 is set as a negative marker of the arterial Term. PECAM1/CDH5/VWF/CLDN5 are pan-EC and discriminate nothing here."], ["", [], []], ["", [], []], ["", [], []], ["", [], []], ["", [], []], ["", [], []], ["", [], []], ["", [], []], ["myoepithelial cell vs basal duct cell", [], "TP63/KRT5/KRT14 are expressed by BOTH; only myoepithelial cells express CNN1, ACTA2 and MYH11 (PMID 42041920). Basal duct cells are additionally NFIB+/KRT15+/SOX2+ (PMID 40254393, 33767405)."], ["ionocyte vs tuft cell", [], "Salivary gland cells previously called 'tuft cells' (narrow apex, apical microvilli) share the ultrastructure of FOXI1/ASCL3/CFTR+ ionocytes."], ["intercalated duct cell vs salivary gland progenitor cell", [], "Both are keyed on KIT/SOX9; the human SMG atlas defines intercalated ducts themselves by 'enriched expression levels of KIT and SOX9' (PMID 36726292)."], ["immunofibroblast vs tertiary lymphoid structure-associated pericyte", ["immunofibroblast"], "Both are CCL19-high stromal cells inside Sjogren salivary-gland TLS and will co-cluster on chemokines alone. Fibroblast side: PDGFRA+, CD82+, TNFSF13B+, CD34+, PDPN+. Mural side: RGS5+, MCAM+, ACTA2+, TNC+, CCL21-very-high, and explicitly TNFSF13B-/CD82-/PDGFRA- (PMID 39747819: 'it lacked expression of TNFSF13B, CD82 and PDGFRA classical of the CCL19 TNFSF13B fibroblast')."], ["pleomorphic adenoma cell vs adenoid cystic carcinoma cell vs myoepithelial cell", ["adenoid cystic carcinoma cell", "pleomorphic adenoma cell"], "All three run the myoepithelial program (ACTA2/TP63/KRT14/KRT5), so those markers are uninformative between them. PA: PLAG1/HMGA2 (plus a PLCG2+ myoepithelial subset). ACC: MYB/NFIB. CXPA: GALNT13 on a PA background."]], "oq": ["HUMAN_SALIVARY_GLAND:0000023", "HUMAN_SALIVARY_GLAND:0000024", "HUMAN_SALIVARY_GLAND:0000010", "HUMAN_SALIVARY_GLAND:0000018", "HUMAN_SALIVARY_GLAND:0000017", "HUMAN_SALIVARY_GLAND:0000001", "HUMAN_SALIVARY_GLAND:0000026", "HUMAN_SALIVARY_GLAND:0000028", "HUMAN_SALIVARY_GLAND:0000032", "HUMAN_SALIVARY_GLAND:0000009"], "ca": [], "sa": [{"name": "osteoclastogenic RANKL program", "markers": ["TNFSF11", "ETS1"], "pmids": ["40136507", "38554844"], "applies_to": ["mesenchymal cell"], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": []}, {"name": "proliferating", "markers": ["MKI67", "TOP2A", "CCNB1", "CENPF"], "pmids": ["12058064"], "applies_to": [], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": ["tissue-resident macrophage", "basal keratinocyte", "fibroblast", "cancer-associated fibroblast", "T cell", "CD8-positive, alpha-beta T cell", "microglial cell", "endothelial cell", "basal prostate epithelial cell", "myeloid cell"]}, {"name": "immunomodulatory", "markers": ["LIF", "IL6", "IL11"], "pmids": ["28232471"], "applies_to": ["fibroblast"], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": ["fibroblast"]}, {"name": "angiogenic", "markers": ["VEGFA", "SPP1", "PGF"], "pmids": ["22760023"],